<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  knowfleet audit-ledger pass (knowfleet task #453) — runs the swamp
  workflow audit-ledger with NO inputs, i.e. its defaults: orchestrate
  only (never dispatch a second auditor), open a run when none is in
  flight, open investigations for machine-revisable verdicts, escalate a
  failed / stalled / needs-human pass to ntfy /alerts.

  Why launchd and not the workflow's trigger.schedule: this repo's swamp
  serve (com.guru.automation-factory-swamp-serve) runs with its no-schedule
  flag and is not necessarily loaded, so a cron trigger would silently
  never fire. Same reasoning as com.guru.a2a-conformance (decision
  38108534).

  Why 14:10 local: the librarian's daily candidate-audit cron
  (6baadbef2952) fires at 14:00 local and creates that day's run. Landing
  ten minutes later means this pass finds the day's run already open and
  adopts it, rather than racing the cron to create one.

  Why no RunAtLoad: a pass can open a reconciliation batch, which spends
  gpt-5.6-sol turns via the auditor poll; a login/boot should not spend
  them. Pacing is capped at 2 batches/UTC-day inside the model.

  Coexistence: the auditor cron 883029b254e4 and investigator cron
  63133383b02c keep authoring verdicts and remediating. While they are
  enabled this workflow will NOT dispatch a second worker onto a run they
  own. Pause them and the workflow takes the loop over — no config change
  here is needed.

  Liveness: every non-dry pass writes
  ~/Scripts/network-status/machines/kimchi/heartbeats/audit-ledger.heartbeat,
  watched by knowfleet's layer-1 heartbeat checker
  (scripts/heartbeat-watch.config). ntfy is escalation only.

  Install: copy to ~/Library/LaunchAgents (so it survives logout/reboot), then
    launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.guru.audit-ledger.plist
  Run now:  launchctl kickstart gui/$(id -u)/com.guru.audit-ledger
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.guru.audit-ledger</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/Users/guru/.local/bin/swamp</string>
    <string>workflow</string>
    <string>run</string>
    <string>audit-ledger</string>
    <string>--repo-dir</string>
    <string>/Users/guru/Code/labs/automation-factory</string>
    <string>--no-color</string>
  </array>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/guru/Code/labs/automation-factory</string>
  <!-- 14:10 local (America/New_York). A missed slot while asleep fires on wake. -->
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>14</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>10</integer>
  </dict>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/guru</string>
    <!-- launchd PATH lacks Homebrew; the model also pins node by absolute path. -->
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
  </dict>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/guru/Library/Logs/audit-ledger.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/guru/Library/Logs/audit-ledger.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
